		<article id="multi-agent-platform">
			<h3>Multi-Agent AI Platform</h3>
			<p><time datetime="2025-01">January 2025</time> &ndash; <time datetime="2025-05">May 2025</time></p>
			<p><strong>Type:</strong> AI Application and Full-Stack Development</p>
			<p>A multi-agent conversational platform that coordinates specialized agents for automation and information retrieval. The system routes each request to the agent best suited for the task instead of asking one model to handle everything.</p>
			<p>I developed a modular framework for mathematical problem solving, weather retrieval, and task management, with real-time orchestration between the agents and the user interface.</p>
			<p><strong>Technologies:</strong> Python, Flask, React, REST APIs, LangGraph</p>
